<title>USA: HealthTech sees annual revs of $25 mln.</title>
<headline>HealthTech sees annual revs of $25 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MESA, Ariz 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>HealthTech International Inc said its January gross revenues totalled $2.1 million, up 550 percent froim year-earlier gross revenues of $380,000.</p>
<p>HealthTech said it currently projects annual gross revenues in excess of $25 million on a forward basis.</p>
<p>The company attributed the dramatic increase in revenues to its entry into the Primary Care medical field.</p>
</text>
